msgid ""
"&ksirk; is a computerized version of a well known strategy game. A "
"commercial version exists and also another GPL clone but I (Gael de "
"Chalendar) created this game as a C++ learning exercise and so, I developped "
"it up to this point (see README for details)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54 index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the current version, &ksirk; is a multi-player network-enabled game with "
"a basic AI. (see TODO for details)"
