#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid "The main KsirK window"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:400
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is at this time only one window and all operations are done by buttons "
"in the toolbar. These buttons are inserted or removed when necessary. Each "
"one have a tooltip; use it to remember yourself its usage. There is no menu "
"nor shortcuts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:407
#, no-c-format
msgid "The buttons"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:419
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quit Game"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:421
#, no-c-format
msgid ": Quit t Game"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:425
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Causes the program to imediatly quit, with no other warning ! Yes, it will "
"be improved in a future version !"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:439
#, no-c-format
