#, no-c-format
msgid "The Data directory"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:580
#, no-c-format
msgid "The onu.xml file"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:581
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This files is a description of the content of the skin. It is used to "
"describe the organization of the world and how to display it. It has the "
"following structure:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:585
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"onu \n"
"        (\n"
"          (skinSpritesData (intItem | strItem )*)\n"
"          (country (flag-point cannons-point cavalry-point infantry-point "
"neighbours (neighbour*) ) )*\n"
"          nationality*\n"
"          (continent (continent-country))*\n"
"        )"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:586
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An onu tag contains a skinSpritesData tag, a number of country tags, a "
"number of nationality tags and lastly a number of continent tags. The "
"skinSpritesData itself contains a number of intItem or strItem tags. The "
"country tag contains some object point tags and a neighbours tag, itself "
"containing a number of neighbour tags."
msgstr ""

